WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Gnomon: Lunar Landing Site Navigator.
Anish G, NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Here the Sun doesn't rise. It circles,
a degree or two above the ridges.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Be the Sun: move the light over
NASA's LOLA map of the south pole.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
250 metres decided Athena's fate:
its crater was smaller than one map pixel.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The console: Power, Comms and Light verdicts,
and every site re-ranked when the launch slips.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Validated against JPL Horizons and NASA LOLA maps.
anish-185.github.io/lunar-landing-site-navigator
